  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Access to Safe Water for Drought affected Households in Ntirim, Isiolo County</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to provide sustainable water  access &amp; food for drought affected households( 500hh/2500persons) in Ntirim village, isiolo County. This will be done through construction and rehabilitation of 4 shallow wells (2 new &amp; 2 Old) fitted with Afridev hand pumps and cattle troughs. The water will be for domestic use and watering of livestock. The most vulnerable households(150hh) will also receive food vouchers equivalent to a family food basket of KES 2500/- per household/month for three months.</narrative>
  </description>
